{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/aLFJ5mAlFoeq3bw75Gcicg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:05.066720+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/aLFJ5mAlFoeq3bw75Gcicg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>医学部卫生应急学院</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2026年全国优秀大学生</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>暑期夏令营活动通知</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>我院举办全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动，旨在为一批热爱科研、基础扎实、素质全面、德才兼备的应届本科毕业生继续深造和发展搭建平台、创造机遇。活动举办期间，将全面介绍院系和学科发展近况，邀请相关领域专家学者开设专题讲座、学术论坛；同时，还有导师见面会等活动。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mzvmdVzKF7TYNjsr3C4LP24QWjJUmmXA2hLvu1H2zqZkSzQbzN63rrickYiashMQ4MVDOspELiahqbCuM665NJh0o5vIaweuml0dlpicW8dfMFc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>承办单位简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>救援医学（应急医学）是近年来发展起来的一门新兴交叉学科，是研究灾害条件下进行医学救援的科学规律、方式、方法、组织的一门学科，涉及灾害医疗救援的各个方面、各个阶段，是灾害救援的重要组成部分。</span></p><p><span>2017年6月，救援医学学科带头人、原中国国际救援队医疗队长兼首席医疗官、原中华医学会灾难医学分会主任委员侯世科教授带领研究团队在天津大学组建应急医学研究院，研究院主要骨干先后参加了印尼海啸、印尼日惹地震、巴基斯坦地震、海地地震、阿尔及利亚地震、玉树地震、汶川地震、黑龙江大兴安岭火灾、天津港“8•12”特大火灾爆炸、安徽抗洪抢险、重大腺病毒疫情防控、抗战胜利70周年外军保障等30余批次国际国内救援行动和重大活动保障，在救援医学领域形成了具有明显优势和特色的研究方向。2024年5月，天津大学依托应急医学研究院成立卫生应急学院（以下简称“应急院”），是国内第一所专门从事应急医学教学培训和科研转化的专业机构，2006年本团队开设了国内第一个“救援医学”本科专业，2020年获批教育部首个“救援医学”一级学科硕士点，2025年获批“应急医学”一级学科博士点，联合美国哈佛医学院贝斯医学中心、美国匹兹堡大学、法国巴黎笛卡尔大学开展国际化合作，打造应急医学“本硕博”贯通的人才培养体系，为国家培养应急医学专业复合型高层次人才。</span></p><p><span>应急院建有应急管理部医学救援关键技术装备重点实验室、天津市灾难医学技术重点实验室、中国智库索引（CTTI）来源智库、天津市卫生应急培训演练基地（5大类）、天津市职业健康应急救援指导中心等省部级学科平台，与天津大学温州安全（应急）研究院进行“两院一体化”建设，开展科研成果转化。应急院作为世界急救与灾难医学协会（WADEM）理事单位，是中华医学会灾难医学分会、中国医师协会急救复苏和灾难医学专业委员会、中国应急管理学会紧急医学工作委员会、中国医学救援协会生命支持技术分会、中国医学救援协会救援防护分会等多个应急医学领域重要学术组织的主委和牵头单位。现有教职工51人，中国科协“求是杰出青年奖”2人，国家科技部重点研发项目首席科学家2人，天津市杰出人才1人、青年优秀科技人才1人，并聘请相关领域8名领域内人才担任学院学术委员会顾问。</span></p><p><span>学院5年来先后承担国家科技支撑计划、国家科技部重点研发计划、国家自然科学基金等国家级和省部级项目50余项，获批科研经费2.8亿元。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请基本资格条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（1）来自教育部公布的“双一流”建设高校或具有推荐免试攻读研究生资格院校的应届本科毕业生。</span></p><p><span>（2）学习成绩优秀，教育部批准设立研究生院的高校学生学习成绩排名须在班级或专业前30％；未设立研究生院的高校或所在专业为国家重点学科院校的学生学习成绩排名在班级或专业前10％；或有突出成果、论文或特殊专业特长者；或在全国重大竞赛中获奖者。</span></p><p><span>（3）英语水平良好，原则上达到英语六级水平（成绩≥425分）或四级成绩优秀（成绩≥550分）或托福（TOEFL）成绩达到90分或雅思（IELTS）成绩达到6分或GRE成绩达到300分。</span></p><p><span>（4）对从事学科学术研究有浓厚兴趣，具有一定创新力和潜能。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请办法</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>（1）招收专业</span></strong></p><p><span>109901  救援医学（医）</span></p><p><span>089901  救援医学（工）</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（2）申报途径：</span></span></strong><span>学员访问天津大学研究生招生信息网—服务系统—暑期夏令营</span><span><span>（网站：https://sszs.tju.edu.cn/10056/user/login/login）</span></span><span>填报申请</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（3）申请时间：</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>6月26日中午12：00-7月7日中午12：00</span></span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>资格审查</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请者须提交</span><strong><span><span>如下材料</span></span></strong><span>（通过报名系统提交电子版照片）：</span></p><p><span>1.证明学习成绩及排名的成绩单或证明件；</span></p><p><span>2.相关证明材料（英语四、六级成绩单；学生证；各类奖励材料）。</span></p><p><span>承办单位以教育背景、学业水平、科研能力、综合素质为主要评价依据，由学科专家对申请者进行资格评审。学院一般将在不晚于7月8日通知合格入围者。未接到入营通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>入营时间、人数</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>参加夏令营的同学须上传申请材料（见第三条款要求）、身份证、学生证，具体日程见入营通知。</span></p><p><span>预计开营时间为:7月13日，具体安排及日程另行通知。营员规模为40人左右，入营名单以电子邮件形式通知本人，未接到入营通知的同学皆视为未录取，不另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动内容</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.专家讲座</span></p><p><span>2.与导师面对面交流</span></p><p><span>3.参观学院</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>组织实施</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>通过入营审核的同学应按规定时间报到，携带本人身份证及学生证。具体实施方案详见后续发布的入营通知。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其它注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.夏令营举办形式为现场，具体入营形式待入营名单确定后另行通知。</span></p><p><span>2.入营营员原则上须全程参加夏令营活动，方有资格参评夏令营优秀营员。</span></p><p><span>3.申报材料及相关信息必须真实，若有造假，一经查实，将被取消参营资格。</span></p><p><span>4.本次夏令营不收取报名费用。</span></p><p><span>5.营员入营期间发生的医疗费用及因个人行为导致的意外事故，由营员本人承担。</span></p><p><span>6.如因不可抗力影响或上级部门出台新政策、安排或计划调整，导致夏令营工作安排或信息变化的，学院将做相应调整，最终以我院发布的相关通知为准，具体另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><sect